  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nationel Expert EUD Myanmar - Nationel Expert EUD Myanmar, BJ</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nationell Expert EUD Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secondment of a Swedish national expert to the EU delegation in Myanmar responsible for political and economic analysis, dialogue and reporting. Special focus on the overall political situation and development in Myanmar concerning Democracy and Huyman Rights.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sekondering till EU-delegationen i Myanmar med ansvar f&#xf6;r politisk och ekonomisk analys, dialog och rapportering. S&#xe4;rskilt avseende om den &#xf6;vergripande situationen och utvecklingen i Myanmar med s&#xe4;rskilt fokus p&#xe5; demokrati och m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter.</narrative>
  </description>
